## Required Workflow

1. Extract the feature name from `Dispatch Context`.
2. Read completely: `.ysda/agents/rust-engineer.md` and `.ysda/agents/code-change-pr-workflow.md`. If either read fails, report `STATUS: BLOCKED` and stop.
3. Invoke `$run-cc-sdd-task <feature> {{taskId}}`.
4. Execute no other cc-sdd task and do not edit `.ralph-tui/generated/*.json`.
5. Treat `.kiro/specs/<feature>/tasks.md`, the approved cc-sdd spec, the actual diff, and fresh command evidence as authoritative. Recent progress is only a hint.
6. Do not emit Ralph's completion promise yourself. Only the repository completion helper invoked by `$run-cc-sdd-task` may emit it after reviewer-gated fresh verification succeeds.
7. If the skill reports a blocker, preserve its evidence, do not widen scope, and end without a completion promise.
